{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"handlebars","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Handlebars","description":"Syntax coloring and snippets for Handlebars (.hbs .handlebars .mustache).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"handlebars","name":"Handlebars","extensions":[".hbs",".handlebars",".mustache"],"grammar":"grammars/handlebars.json","blockComment":["{{!--","--}}"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Handlebars","path":"snippets/handlebars.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/handlebars.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"<!--\",\n      \"end\": \"-->\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{\\\\{![^}]*\\\\}\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\{\\\\{!\\\\-\\\\-\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\-\\\\-\\\\}\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\{\\\\{\\\\{?[#/^>&]?\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\}?\\\\}\\\\}\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"(?<=\\\\{\\\\{[#/^]?)[A-Za-z_]+\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"</?[A-Za-z][A-Za-z0-9-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z-]+(?==)\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"/?>\",\n      \"token\": \"tag\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/handlebars.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Each\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"each\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{#each ${1:items}}}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"{{/each}}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"#each\"\n  },\n  \"If\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"if\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{#if ${1:condition}}}\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"{{/if}}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"#if\"\n  },\n  \"Partial\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"part\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{{> ${1:name}}}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A partial\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Handlebars\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Handlebars.\n\n## Files\n\n`.hbs`, `.handlebars`, `.mustache`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `each` | #each |\n| `if` | #if |\n| `part` | A partial |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}